        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n" value="&lt;b&gt;Determinism&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed dt is already in Application. For replay / network: fixed solver iterations, avoid unordered hash maps in pair generation, optional integer accumulators. Document IEEE vs deterministic mode in hardware.md when implemented." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
