        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n" value="&lt;b&gt;How to climb a tier without breaking everywhere&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1) Keep ISimulation and a CPU scalar reference solver (correctness + web fallback).&lt;br&gt;2) Add jobs/SIMD behind the same step().&lt;br&gt;3) Add ICompute; feature-flag GPU.&lt;br&gt;4) Never make raylib types part of the world data.&lt;br&gt;5) Benchmark per tier on CI micro-worlds so a GPU kernel cannot silently break the cube demo." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
